# Premium Presentations

This project has a full presentation-building skill at
`skills/premium-presentations/SKILL.md` in this repo (or wherever you copied
the `skills/premium-presentations/` folder). Read that file in full before
building any deck — it covers the design-interview step, the deck-spec
format, the two generator scripts (`build_deck.py` for the editable .pptx,
`render_preview.py` for an animated HTML preview), and the real-data policy.

Quick reference:
- Don't guess the visual theme if the user didn't specify one — ask, and
  show `skills/premium-presentations/assets/theme_gallery.html`.
- Generate the .pptx natively with `build_deck.py` (python-pptx) — never by
  converting HTML, which breaks editability.
- Fill decks with real data pulled from the user's files/context or live
  research; flag genuine gaps instead of inventing numbers.
